      <p begin="01:17.000" end="01:18.790" ttm:agent="v1">Échame la culpa</p>
      <p begin="01:18.790" end="01:22.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No eres tú, no eres tú, no eres tú, soy yo (soy yo)</p>
      <p begin="01:22.120" end="01:23.780" ttm:agent="v1">No te quiero hacer sufrir</p>
      <p begin="01:23.780" end="01:27.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Es mejor olvidar y dejarlo así (así)</p>
      <p begin="01:27.250" end="01:28.820" ttm:agent="v1">Échame la culpa</p>
      <p begin="01:28.820" end="01:30.910" ttm:agent="v1">Solamente te falta un beso</p>
      <p begin="01:30.910" end="01:33.520" ttm:agent="v1">Solamente te falta un beso</p>
      <p begin="01:33.520" end="01:37.090" ttm:agent="v1">Ese beso que siempre te prometí</p>
      <p begin="01:37.090" end="01:38.670" ttm:agent="v1">Échame la culpa</p>
      <p begin="01:38.670" end="01:41.050" ttm:agent="v1">Solamente te falta un beso</p>
      <p begin="01:41.050" end="01:43.640" ttm:agent="v1">Solamente te falta un beso</p>
      <p begin="01:43.640" end="01:46.910" ttm:agent="v1">Ese beso que siempre te prometí</p>
      <p begin="01:46.910" end="01:48.750" ttm:agent="v1">Échame la culpa</p>
      <p begin="01:48.750" end="01:50.250" ttm:agent="v1">Okay</p>
      <p begin="01:49.700" end="01:51.980" ttm:agent="v1">I don't really, really wanna fight anymore</p>
      <p begin="01:51.980" end="01:54.660" ttm:agent="v1">I don't really, really wanna fake it no more</p>
      <p begin="01:54.660" end="01:56.980" ttm:agent="v1">Play me like The Beatles, baby, just let it be</p>
      <p begin="01:56.980" end="01:59.840" ttm:agent="v1">So come and put the blame on me, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:59.840" end="02:02.280" ttm:agent="v1">I don't really, really wanna fight anymore</p>
      <p begin="02:02.280" end="02:04.620" ttm:agent="v1">I don't really, really wanna fake it no more</p>
      <p begin="02:04.620" end="02:07.150" ttm:agent="v1">Play me like The Beatles, baby, just let it be</p>
